 |                        ESP32 GATEWAY - ARQUITECTURA PUENTE                        |
 |                                                                                   |
 |  +-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+  |
 |  |                         MATRIZ DE ENRUTAMIENTO IP                           |  |
 |  +-------+------------------------------+------------------------------+-------+  |
 |          |                              |                              |          |
 |          v                              v                              v          |
 |  +---------------+              +---------------+              +---------------+  |
 |  |  Cliente MQTT |              |  Túnel UDP    |              | Servidor      |  |
 |  |  (Discovery)  |              |  (CAN-over-IP)|              | Modbus TCP    |  |
 |  +-------+-------+              +-------+-------+              +-------+-------+  |
 |          |                              |                              |          |
 |          +------------------------------+------------------------------+          |
 |                                         |                                         |
 |                                         v                                         |
 |                        +---------------------------------+                        |
 |                        |   MOTOR DE TRADUCCIÓN DE TRAMAS |                        |
 |                        |   Y TABLAS DE MAPEO INTERNO     |                        |
 |                        +----------------+----------------+                        |
 |                                         |                                         |
 |          +------------------------------+------------------------------+          |
 |          |                                                             |          |
 |          v                                                             v          |
 |  +---------------+                                             +---------------+  |
 |  | Controlador   |                                             | Controlador   |  |
 |  | CAN (TWAI)    |                                             | RS-485        |  |
